00:03:41.322 --> 00:03:44.489
Careful. That's my mom's.


00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:49.161
Harper, you had a bruise
on your face.


00:03:56.237 --> 00:03:58.070
Do you see a bruise?


00:03:58.072 --> 00:04:00.105
