00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:10.902
No, it's cool. So, wait.


00:06:10.904 --> 00:06:12.170
Do you... Do you know Bailey?


00:06:12.172 --> 00:06:14.306
Yeah. Yeah,
we met freshman year.


00:06:14.308 --> 00:06:17.342
Are you one of her
yoga students?


00:06:17.344 --> 00:06:18.643
