00:13:12.993 --> 00:13:14.425
Wait. Hold up.


00:13:14.427 --> 00:13:16.161
- Thanks.
- Evan!


00:13:16.163 --> 00:13:19.397
I'm comin' for ya.
I'm comin' for ya.


00:13:19.399 --> 00:13:20.965
Rah!


00:13:24.671 --> 00:13:25.503
Oh.


